WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.480
All right, so let me show you some examples on the real chat.

00:03.480 --> 00:06.120
So let's suppose that we are in a downtrend

00:06.120 --> 00:09.680
and then we are looking to identify market structure breaks.

00:09.680 --> 00:12.640
Okay, we are looking for market structure breaks.

00:12.640 --> 00:16.880
Okay, so as you can see, price made a new lower low,

00:16.880 --> 00:21.880
lower high, lower low, lower high, lower low, lower high,

00:22.320 --> 00:27.320
lower low, lower high, and then lower low,

00:28.160 --> 00:31.200
made another lower high,

00:31.200 --> 00:34.240
then we made a lower low once again.

00:34.240 --> 00:36.880
So now this type of market structure

00:36.880 --> 00:41.880
is considered to be a market structure break, okay?

00:43.520 --> 00:47.000
When price continuously makes new lower lows

00:48.040 --> 00:50.800
and the trend is continuing,

00:50.800 --> 00:54.640
that is considered to be a market structure break, okay?

00:54.640 --> 00:58.320
So as you can see, right around this level,

00:58.320 --> 00:59.360
price broke through it,

00:59.360 --> 01:01.800
that is considered to be market structure break,

01:01.800 --> 01:05.240
then we pull it back and then price broke through

01:05.240 --> 01:07.000
that previous low low,

01:07.000 --> 01:08.720
and you can see that this is considered

01:08.720 --> 01:11.000
to be market structure break as well.

01:11.000 --> 01:14.240
Now what is market structure shift?

01:14.240 --> 01:17.540
So as you can see that we were continuously making

01:17.540 --> 01:20.800
lower lows, lower highs, lower lows, lower highs,

01:20.840 --> 01:25.840
but then we made a higher high, higher low, and higher high.

01:27.240 --> 01:28.840
Now this is considered to be,

01:30.760 --> 01:33.800
now this break right around here,

01:33.800 --> 01:37.160
when price breaks through this level,

01:37.160 --> 01:39.840
which is the previous low,

01:39.840 --> 01:41.840
we made a lower low, lower high,

01:41.840 --> 01:44.840
lower low, lower high, then lower low,

01:44.840 --> 01:47.040
and then price reversed,

01:47.120 --> 01:51.600
breaking the previous low of the bearish trend.

01:51.600 --> 01:56.600
Now this is considered to be a market structure shift.

01:57.600 --> 01:59.960
Very, very easy guys.

01:59.960 --> 02:02.720
I hope you understood what I thought you guys.

02:02.720 --> 02:06.960
So this is considered to be market structure shift.

02:06.960 --> 02:10.280
So I hope this is clear,

02:10.280 --> 02:11.640
and as you can see,

02:11.640 --> 02:14.320
the price has continued up for a bit,

02:14.320 --> 02:16.800
but then it made another, as you can see,

02:16.800 --> 02:19.760
price made another market structure shift.

02:19.760 --> 02:23.360
So we made a higher high, higher low, higher high,

02:23.360 --> 02:28.360
and then we created this lower low, lower high,

02:28.360 --> 02:32.600
and then lower low, lower high, lower low.

02:32.600 --> 02:36.280
Okay, so you can see how we identified the markets.

02:36.280 --> 02:38.800
Now this was, this move right here,

02:39.720 --> 02:41.680
when price broke this level,

02:41.680 --> 02:45.360
then it is considered be a market structure shift.

02:45.360 --> 02:47.080
So I hope this is clear now,

02:47.080 --> 02:49.040
and I'll see you guys in the next video.

